*.lck

# DelosDB smoke-test databases generated by root-level JavaExec proofs
# Keep both the database directory and its nested Derby log/seg0 files out of VCS.
# Root-level Derby databases created by storage smoke tests.
# If any of these were already tracked before this rule existed, untrack them once in Git/IDE.
/storage-phase-*-db
/storage-phase-*-db/
/storage-phase-*-db/**

